  "question": {
    "text": "If the <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math>, term of an A.P. is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, and its <math><msup><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math>, term is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math>, then the sum of its first <math><mn>200</mn></math>, terms is."
